{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-i", "title": "公孫丑上", "description": "公孫丑問曰：「夫子當路於齊，管仲、晏子之功，可復許乎？」\n孟子曰：「子誠齊人也，知管仲、晏子而已矣。或問乎曾西曰：『吾子與子路孰賢？』曾西蹴然曰：『吾先子之所畏也。』曰：『然則吾子與管仲孰賢？』曾西艴然不悅，曰：『爾何曾比予於管仲？管仲得君，如彼其專也；行乎國政，如彼其久也；功烈，如彼其卑也。爾何曾比予於是？』」曰：「", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "夫子", "id": "夫子"}, {"form": "學", "id": "學"}, {"form": "役", "id": "役"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "端", "id": "端"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聖", "id": "聖"}, {"form": "辭", "id": "辭"}, {"form": "願", "id": "願"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.131136910560194, "source": "學", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 2.948815353766239, "source": "學", "target": "願"}, {"weight": 1.7201499368499318, "source": "役", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.2556681732062938, "source": "役", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.131136910560194, "source": "役", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 3.6419625343261846, "source": "役", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.794664673938981, "source": "役", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.3542804618744038, "source": "役", "target": "恥"}, {"weight": 1.0270027562899864, "source": "聖", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.0325246218920845, "source": "聖", "target": "夫子"}, {"weight": 0.6462302607721937, "source": "聖", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.214846178686039, "source": "聖", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 0.5661875530986572, "source": "聖", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 0.9228624970373895, "source": "知", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.057842429876374, "source": "知", "target": "辭"}, {"weight": 1.2593347336586025, "source": "知", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 0.47087737329433244, "source": "知", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.7701603574245932, "source": "知", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.0770131768646478, "source":